          "contents": "# Create three string variables below using input()\n# Base these on the labels from your SketchLab sketch\n\n\n# Create one int variable and one bool variable\n# Assign these directly -- don't use input() for these\n\n\n# Reassign one of your variables based on a new value\n\n\n# Print out all of your variables, including the one you reassigned\n\n\n# --- AI-generated visual goes below ---\n# Give your code and your backpack sketch to the AI Tutor and ask it to\n# build a Theater scene using the variables above. Remember to predict,\n# run, and evaluate its code before accepting it.",
